abstract: "Drug response prediction in cancer cell lines (GDSC v17.3 AUC) from gene expression (DepMap 19Q1) with random forest, penalized regression and linear SVM in R. Code of a Master's thesis (MSc in Bioinformatics and Biostatistics, UOC-UB, 2019) published unchanged except for text encoding and a provenance header, with a reproducible data download, a renv environment and a list of errata, plus a corrected reimplementation (v1.0) that fixes the errata and is evaluated by repeated stratified cross-validation. Research and teaching only; not a clinical tool."
